{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">郭珮文（Juliana）在《女神配對計劃2》中迎來兩位極具誠意的「求愛勇者」，包括驚喜現身的前度 Ice，以及默契十足的新追求者 Preston。面對這場備受矚目的三角關係，Juliana 今日（15日）罕有在社交平台發表長文，大方剖白對兩男的真實看法與內心掙扎。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b1d10664-fe07-4e23-a531-4fb384a91480.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026BJhJh0ZfDb1789464651.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b1d10664-fe07-4e23-a531-4fb384a91480.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">談到相戀3年、去年才分手的舊愛 Ice，Juliana 坦言當初分開並無任何原則性問題，純粹是因為對未來充滿不確定性。對於前度今次特意漂洋過海來參加節目「箍煲」，她直認心情複雜又高興：「客觀來説，我們的性格、相處模式一直都很契合、很合適。我真的有看到他的誠意。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Juliana 更表示期待對方接下來的表現：「想看看我們當初跨不過去的那些距離和未來的不確定，能不能在這次慢慢被解決、被磨合。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"513c767a-136f-400d-a3a4-8fccf061b16f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026S8rmi8K2h11789464650.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"513c767a-136f-400d-a3a4-8fccf061b16f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">至於另一邊廂的新追求者 Preston，Juliana 亦毫不吝嗇對他的好感。她大讚對方與自己的成長經歷及觀念非常相似，相處起來極度舒服自然。最令Juliana 心動的，是兩人都對美食有著極高追求：「這個小默契對我來説真的很加分！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對這兩位截然不同、卻同樣極具好感的追求者，Juliana 強調目前對兩人都十分尊重，並認為感情不需要急著下定論，希望能給予彼此更多時間相處與磨合。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0c34e9a3-63ae-4de5-ba49-a5d5972a0e2e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ToHAo1TMvM1789464650.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0c34e9a3-63ae-4de5-ba49-a5d5972a0e2e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T10:21:03.376459+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":521,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}